Pneuma downloads and runs third-party tools at the user's request
(avr-gcc, avrdude and the Arduino AVR core from the Arduino package index;
optionally arduino-cli). They are not part of this repository and keep their
own licenses (GPL/LGPL/etc.). Pneuma only invokes them as separate programs.
